# Harness files vendored from new-sdlc — present so Claude/Obsidian can use
# them, but canonically versioned only in the new-sdlc repo itself. Not
# tracked per-project to avoid duplicating/drifting the same content across
# every vault's history.
.claude/commands
.obsidian
templates
CLAUDE.md

# project/ is its own independent git repository (the public/private code repo),
# nested inside the vault but never tracked by the vault's own history.
project/

# Serena MCP's per-checkout local state, not part of the template.
.serena/

# Local MCP config — carries a live Obsidian REST API bearer token, machine-specific.
.mcp.json
